[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17820.15, "timestamp": "04:57:00", "text": "明白了，那很糟糕，我总是忘记……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17821.628, "timestamp": "04:57:01", "text": "推特我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17824.27, "timestamp": "04:57:04", "text": "直播的时候我总是忘记"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17826.31, "timestamp": "04:57:06", "text": "因为我今天又像这样了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17828.51, "timestamp": "04:57:08", "text": "又一个忙碌的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17831.39, "timestamp": "04:57:11", "text": "天哪，我最讨厌这种情况发生了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17835.19, "timestamp": "04:57:15", "text": "忙碌的一天总是让你无暇顾及其他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17838.27, "timestamp": "04:57:18", "text": "我觉得我不知道，那很累。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17841.83, "timestamp": "04:57:21", "text": "说实话，今天真是累人的一天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17845.67, "timestamp": "04:57:25", "text": "你知道，那天真是累坏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17851.31, "timestamp": "04:57:31", "text": "所以当时我真的真的真的好忙，我当时就想什么时候……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17854.39, "timestamp": "04:57:34", "text": "我直播，所以老实说，最近就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17856.47, "timestamp": "04:57:36", "text": "我好像经常这么说，是吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17858.31, "timestamp": "04:57:38", "text": "我一直在想他们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17863.23, "timestamp": "04:57:43", "text": "我一直想直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17866.15, "timestamp": "04:57:46", "text": "当我可以的时候等等等等，但是我已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17867.868, "timestamp": "04:57:47", "text": "因为种种原因，一直无法进行流媒体播放。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17870.27, "timestamp": "04:57:50", "text": "我又忙于工作了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17873.91, "timestamp": "04:57:53", "text": "一切都好，所以，嗯，没关系，所以，呃，会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17876.99, "timestamp": "04:57:56", "text": "你喜欢玩教程吗？好的，我们开始吧。"}]